  "description": "At the start of her second year of middle school, Ji Hae-Ro ends up in the same class as her ex-boyfriend, whom she’d been secretly dating before he dumped her.\n\nBut wait a minute! It’s bad enough that I’m in the same class as the guy who dumped me, but now he’s telling me he has a crush on someone in our class? And of all people, that person happens to be… Choi Jin-Young?! \n\nThere’s one secret between Ji Hae-Ro and Choi Jin-young that no one else is supposed to know…\n\nSurrounded by nothing but unwelcome guests, will Hae-Ro be able to make it through puberty unscathed?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
